  "priorExpiration": "2019-08-22",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 837.16 Screening for Other Bases of Medicaid Eligibility Prior to Suspension, Termination, Disenrollment, or Denial of Eligibility. Suspension, termination, disenrollment, or denial of eligibility shall only occur after a beneficiary is screened and determined to be ineligible for all other bases of medicaid eligibility and reviewed for eligibility for insurance affordability programs in accordance with 42 CFR 435.916(f).\n\nSource. #12733, INTERIM, eff 2-23-19, EXPIRES: 8-22-19; ss by #12796, eff 6-5-19 (formerly He-W 837.17)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-w800.html"
